  "details": "Description\n\nIn the emojis and stickers wheel, if you try to add more stickers or emojis when it’s maxed out, the button add still shows up unlike before, and does nothing.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nFill the emojis and stickers wheels with a bunch of them. At some point, you’ll reach the maximum you can put in there, but the plus sign still shows up. To avoid confusion, instead of a plus sign \"Add\", it should be a bag sign \"Manage\" if the idea is to have a button to access menu to change emojis/stickers.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1912-2cf53b8d24-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-15_20-32-54.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_bd4b076c-93cc-4321-8483-428b2c259b25/1/file)",
